      "text": "2026 Bowman Football Red Rookie Redemption Arrives!\nCelebrate careers. Collect value. Fuel your fandom.\nDATE: OCT 8, 2026\nTOPICS: 2026 BOWMAN FOOTBALL, BOWMAN RED ROOKIE REDEMPTION, TRENDING\nLENGTH: 494 WORDS\nREADING TIME: ~3 MINUTES\n\nThe Red RC Redemption program comes to the NFL with 2026 Bowman Football. Each 2026 Bowman Football Red RC card features a rookie eligible for the 2026 NFL Offensive Rookie of the Year (OROY) award, and you can redeem those cards for FanCash as the players reach career milestones.\n\nOnce the 2026 OROY is announced, you can redeem the winner’s 2026 Bowman Football Red RC for FanCash through your Fanatics Collect account, or hold the card for potential future achievements and milestones. Each Red RC can be redeemed only once.\n\nFanCash payouts start at $150 for Offensive Rookie of the Year and reach $1,100 for Pro Football Hall of Fame induction.\n\nHow It Works\nCollect: 2026 Bowman Football Red RCs\nDecide: After the 2026 NFL Offensive Rookie of the Year is announced, redeem the OROY Red RC for FanCash or hold for higher milestones\nRedeem: Submit your card through your Fanatics Collect account\nReceive: Once verified, your account is credited with FanCash\nHold: This is optional if you choose not to redeem a Red Rookie Redemption-eligible card\nFanCash Payouts by Milestone\n\n*Red RC players who win Offensive Rookie of the Year will unlock the opportunity for MVP payouts; Red RC players who win Offensive Rookie of the Year and MVP will unlock the opportunity for Pro Football Hall of Fame payouts.\n\n2026 Bowman Football Red RC Checklist\nFernando Mendoza, Las Vegas Raiders®\tTy Simpson, Los Angeles Rams®\tDrew Allar, Pittsburgh Steelers®\tCarson Beck, Arizona Cardinals®\tGarrett Nussmeier, Kansas City Chiefs®\nCade Klubnik, New York Jets®\tCole Payton, Philadelphia Eagles®\tTaylen Green, Cleveland Browns®\tCarnell Tate, Tennessee Titans®\tJordyn Tyson, New Orleans Saints®\nMakai Lemon, Philadelphia Eagles®\tKC Concepcion, Cleveland Browns®\tMalachi Fields, New York Giants®\tDenzel Boston, Cleveland Browns®\tChris Brazzell II, Carolina Panthers®\nGermie Bernard, Pittsburgh Steelers®\tOmar Cooper Jr, New York Jets®\tTed Hurst, Tampa Bay Buccaneers®\tDe’Zhaun Stribling, San Francisco 49ers®\tZachariah Branch, Atlanta Falcons®\nAntonio Williams, Washington Commanders®\tCaleb Douglas, Miami Dolphins®\tJa’Kobi Lane, Baltimore Ravens®\tBrenen Thompson, Los Angeles Chargers®\tJeremiyah Love, Arizona Cardinals®\nJonah Coleman, Denver Broncos®\tEmmett Johnson, Kansas City Chiefs®\tJadarian Price, Seattle Seahawks®\tKenyon Sadiq, New York Jets®\tEli Stowers, Philadelphia Eagles®\nWhat is FanCash?\n\nFanCash is Fanatics’ loyalty currency that you can use to shop, play, and bet with Fanatics. To earn and use FanCash across all our sites and apps, use the same email address for both your Fanatics ID and your Fanatics.com account.\n\nWhere You Can Use FanCash\n\nTurn your FanCash into authentic apparel, Bonus Bets, collectibles, and one-of-a-kind experiences.\n\nTopps: Buy official trading cards and collectibles.\nFanatics Live: Shop cards with live sellers.\nFanatics Collect: Buy, sell, & vault trading cards.\nFanatics: Shop your favorite team’s apparel & memorabilia.\nFanatics Sportsbook: Make bets and play slots & table games.\nTickets: Watch your favorite teams and sports live.\nFanatics ONE Shop: Shop exclusive products from your favorite brands.\nFanatics Fest: Purchase tickets and redeem onsite.\nLids: Shop custom hats and more at 1,000+ Lids stores.\n\nSHARING IS CARING\nRelated\nBowman Red RC Redemption Continues in 2026 Bowman Chrome Baseball\nSEP 10, 2026\nRed Rookie Redemption Returns\nSEP 22, 2025\nBowman Red Rookie Redemption\nAPR 29, 2025\nBowman Red Rookie Redemption Visual Checklist\nAPR 29, 2025",
